# apt sources for the Kali build. mkosi only writes its own when this file is absent, and
# its own would insist on the Kali keyring being installed in the tools tree, which the
# Fedora tools tree cannot provide; here the keyring comes from this sandbox tree.
#
# The build downloads from kali.download, Kali's own CDN, not from http.kali.org: that one
# redirects every download to a mirror near the runner, and a dead mirror there fails the
# build (mirror.us.cdn-perfprod.com, in October 2026). This file feeds the build only. The
# image gets the sources mkosi writes for it, which name http.kali.org whatever is here.
Types: deb
URIs: http://kali.download/kali
Suites: kali-rolling
Components: main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/kali-archive-keyring.gpg
